Third-party components
----------------------
OpenArch Studio runs alongside, and does not redistribute, the following components. Licenses were
checked against each upstream repository or model card. Docling image components were checked at the
versions the image pins (docling-serve v1.38.2, Docling 2.142.1, docling-ibm-models 4.0.4, rapidocr
3.10.0, easyocr 1.7.2), except the exceptions below. Docling 2.142.1 pins the layout-heron,
layout-heron ONNX and DocumentFigureClassifier v2.5 models to the floating revision `main` (no fixed
commit), so those three were checked at `main`; the pinned revision is not confirmable. Components
not in the Docling image (Tika, Ollama, nomic-embed-text, Llama) were checked at their default
branch or model card. text-embeddings-inference was checked at tag v1.9.0; the cpu-1.9 and
cpu-arm64-1.9 image tags float across 1.9.x patch releases, so the exact patch is not pinned.
BAAI/bge-reranker-base was checked at revision 2cfc18c, but the reranker downloads the model's
default branch.

